version 0.1.1
component sw-ts-1187

# 5.2×5.2mm SMD tactile switch, SPST normally open, four pins in two pairs: 1-2 and 3-4 (datasheet schematic).
# Pads per datasheet "P.C.B LAYOUT": outline 8.0×4.8mm, inner gap 4.4×2.6mm, i.e. pads 1.8×1.1mm.
# KiCad official library has no 5.2×5.2 four-pin tactile footprint; build one from this diagram when exporting the PCB.
kind         part
mpn          TS-1187
manufacturer Shuofang Precision
category     switch
package      SMD-5.2x5.2mm-4P
datasheet    https://uploadcdn.oneyac.com/attachments/files/brand_pdf/sofng/TS-1187.pdf

symbol project:sw-push
footprint project:switch-5x5-4

pins
  1  A  passive
  2  A  passive
  3  B  passive
  4  B  passive
